## Summary

I implemented T2 ("Remove generation request journaling end to end") in the `/tmp/cf-stumble-wt/T2` worktree on branch `work/T2`:

- Deleted `src/supervisor/control/journal.ts` and all journal machinery (SQLite table, request-id lookup, command fingerprinting) from `src/supervisor/control/index.ts`.
- Removed `requestId` from `GenerationRequest`/RPC types, HTTP request bodies (`src/routes/generations.ts`), and the owner page (`script-generations.ts`, `markup.ts`, `element-ids.ts`, plus the now-dead `newRequestId()` helper in `script-helpers.ts`).
